{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/925233-vampiric-flight-bloodline-or-devotion","id":925233,"title":"Vampiric Flight - Bloodline or Devotion?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-02T23:07:21-07:00","id":925233,"title":"Vampiric Flight - Bloodline or Devotion?","content":"It's come up enough times in books and movies, and the people I play with have brought the idea up once or twice. I think it's entirely appropriate but I can't decide if it should be a Bloodline's Discipline, with flight toward the end, or if it should straight be a Devotion.<br /> <br /> If I were to make it a Devotion, I could imagine something like - <br /> <br /> <b>Flight of the Damned</b><br /> Celerity \u2022\u2022\u2022, Majesty \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022, Resilience \u2022\u2022<br /> <br /> Sort of imposing your will against gravity and resistance by way of Majesty through the medium of Celerity, with Resilience to keep it from being a transitory effect. <br /> <br /> Any thoughts or suggestions are appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11726-solana","name":"Solana","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11726_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"342"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-03T00:30:46-07:00","id":925249,"title":"","content":"This take on Celerity was pretty interesting. Might be something you can consider.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://wiki.stryck.com/WoD/Celerity\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://wiki.stryck.com/pub/skins/gemini/images/NinjaPunchesShark.gif\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://wiki.stryck.com/WoD/Celerity\" target=\"_blank\"> Celerity &lt; WoD | Stryck Wiki </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://wiki.stryck.com/WoD/Celerity\" target=\"_blank\"> http://wiki.stryck.com/WoD/Celerity </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7234-the-dreamweaver","name":"The Dreamweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7234_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"358"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-03T00:44:26-07:00","id":925255,"title":"","content":"One of the protean 4 options let's you grow wings for full flight already. For a devotion that allows flight without actually growing wings I'd probably make it vigor 2 or 3 on its own, or maybe add in celerity 2 or 3 as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6365-fumus","name":"Fumus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6365_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-03T02:04:30-07:00","id":925274,"title":"","content":"I do like the idea of Celerity (and other physical disciplines) becoming a typical tiered discipline, and granting Flight towards the end. Might be a homebrew design space worth looking into.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1130_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1045"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-03T02:54:25-07:00","id":925285,"title":"","content":"I wrote this a while back, might serve your purpose: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1q3dMgL9v7Vryw-uvWzJ8meJrvvQDjGD6_vjJLPGCjso/edit#heading=h.valhrd55ibua\" target=\"_blank\">Subvolo</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <b>Mod Voice is <u><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></u>*</b><br /> <i>*All other colors should be read aloud in the voice of Don Knotts</i><b>.</b> <hr /><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/18519-pendragon-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">Hacks and House Rules Hub Thread</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>CofD Hacks By Splat: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13vBLaS5Ua1Ez-cVyK6uFa4ssvYeIIZpoA5GQTXytfcA/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Vampire</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sqltG7X-C_MdEe00PtVOZmki8V_K1M1FpQtLwTvb2jg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#006400\">Werewolf</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bpr1EjQ4RfZ5dz-tXmJJ93P2f_l7fUIUwpPLWs9Z-SI/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">Mage</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vKpSTktCUuUaqxXncG4txQPtvPclzXlFZEEX7tbrTSg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Mummy</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Spynbcs_VgCDHdooKWXobZNe6C9CMjONeRTlvXIq9fI/edit?usp=drive_web\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Demon</span></a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/148-pendragon","name":"PenDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1657"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-03T04:43:44-07:00","id":925298,"title":"","content":"On your Devotion itself: I think 10 dots spread over 3 Disciplines is quite a hefty price for a utility power that is almost eclipsed by regular high Celerity, Protean or Vigor, through insane speed, actual wings and super jumps respectively. I think there are many ways to skin that cat, but a Celerity 2/3, Vigor 2/3 Devotion sounds about right. Motion (Celerity) and force (Vigor) are applied.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Politeness is the lubricant of social intercourse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/272-saibot","name":"saibot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1063"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-03T08:22:34-07:00","id":925352,"title":"","content":"Also, you can use Protean 4 to grow wings, jump higher and farther for a flight boost with Celerity + Vigor and then hide yourself with Obfuscate (or a chameleon skin-like Unnatural Aspect)..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-03T12:16:19-07:00","id":925453,"title":"","content":"I would recommend Vigor over Celerity - Vigor covers vertical movement with its jumping ability bonus, while Celerity acts like a psuedo-teleport ability. Hovering in the air doesn't really fit Celerity's ability, whereas it fits Vigor much better.<br /> <br /> Personally, I am the mind that we shouldn't need bloodlines to cover unique abilities; devotions and blood sorceries cover that well enough. Bloodlines can give bonuses to make you better at some abilities, but it shouldn't be something that no one else can do to a lesser extent. So, in this case, I will always say devotion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}